            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The&nbsp;Nepean Sportsplex&nbsp;Curling Centre is the only public curling facility in the Ottawa area welcoming all levels of curlers. Join one of our leagues or pay as you play during drop-in times.</p>
<h3>Amenities</h3>
<ul>
<li>Ten sheets of ice</li>
<li>Curling leagues</li>
<li>Brooms and sliders available at no extra charge.</li>
<li>Lockers available but please bring your own lock.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Drop-in curling fees</h3>
<p><strong>Fees shown do not include HST. </strong>Applicable taxes will be added during the payment process.</p>
